!Loofah::ScrubberNotFound: not a Scrubber or a scrubber name: :nope
!Loofah::ScrubberNotFound: not a Scrubber or a scrubber name: "strip"
!ArgumentError: direction sideways must be one of :top_down or :bottom_up
!Loofah::ScrubberNotFound: No scrub method has been defined on Loofah::Scrubber
